>delete post
    >>removes post from feed
    >>removes post from profile
>post settings
    >>private
        >>>a post that only you can see 
        >>>a draft of a post
    >>friends
        >>>a post that only people who follow you and you follow back can see
    >>followers
        >>>a post that only your followers can see
    >>public
        >>>a post that everyone with the app can see
    >>comments
        >>>Block comments
            >>>>No users can comment on your specific post
        >>>limit comments to friends
            >>>>only friends can comment on given post
        >>>limit comments to followers
            >>>>only followers can comment on given post
        >>>public comments
            >>>>everyone can comment on given post
